<% layout('layouts/boilerplate') %>

<div class="info-page-container">
  <div class="info-header">
    <span class="info-header-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i> Legal & Trust</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: October 2026 • Effective Date: October 28, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="info-prose">
    <p class="lead">
      At <strong>ON AIR</strong>, we value your trust. This Privacy Policy details how we collect, store, use, and protect your personal information when you use our website, mobile interfaces, and booking services.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information you provide directly to us when creating an account, booking stays, or communicating with hosts:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account Details:</strong> Your username, verified email address, profile image, and encrypted password credentials (stored using salted cryptographic scrypt hashing; never in plaintext).</li>
      <li><strong>Reservation Information:</strong> Travel dates, guest counts, chosen stays, host communications, and booking IDs.</li>
      <li><strong>Payment Metadata:</strong> Transaction reference tokens and payment confirmations. Complete credit card numbers are handled securely by PCI-compliant payment gateways and never touch our primary database.</li>
      <li><strong>Reviews & Content:</strong> Feedback, ratings, and listing descriptions you publish publicly on the platform.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We process your personal information strictly for legitimate operational purposes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>To process, confirm, and manage your stay reservations and host communications.</li>
      <li>To verify identities, safeguard against fraudulent transactions, and enforce platform safety rules.</li>
      <li>To calculate accurate booking pricing, including cleaning and service fee breakdowns.</li>
      <li>To provide customer support and power our real-time AI Travel Concierge (E.D.I.T.H.).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Cookies & Session Storage</h2>
    <p>
      ON AIR uses secure, HTTP-only session cookies and CSRF (Cross-Site Request Forgery) protection tokens to keep you safely logged in and guard against unauthorized requests. We do not use third-party cross-site advertising tracking cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data to advertisers or third-party brokers.</strong> Information is shared solely with:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Hosts:</strong> Only the essential traveler details (name, guest count, check-in dates) needed to coordinate your stay.</li>
      <li><strong>Infrastructure Providers:</strong> Secure database and cloud hosting providers (e.g. MongoDB Atlas, Vercel) bound by strict confidentiality agreements.</li>
      <li><strong>Legal Authorities:</strong> Solely when compelled by valid legal processes, court orders, or to protect the vital safety of individuals.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Security Standards</h2>
    <p>
      We implement rigorous industry-standard administrative and technical safeguards. All web traffic is encrypted using modern TLS (HTTPS), and user passwords are automatically hashed with unique per-user salts prior to storage in MongoDB Atlas.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
    <p>Under applicable data privacy regulations (including India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act and global privacy standards), you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access and review the personal information associated with your account.</li>
      <li>Update or edit your account information and change your password at any time.</li>
      <li>Request permanent deletion of your account and associated reservation history.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Contact Our Data Protection Officer</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data rights, contact our privacy team at <a href="mailto:privacy@onair.com" class="fw-bold text-dark">privacy@onair.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
